{"sections":[{"slug":"广义同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"广义同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">广义同调</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"广义同调"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">广义同调一般是指空间范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的满足某些同调公理的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在空间较好的情形可由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>:\n$$\r\nE_n(X) = \\pi_n(X\\wedge E).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">除了用谱表示的广义同调外</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">还有其它一些概念可作为同调的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">详见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">初等定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">同调理论</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为满足如下条件</span> (Eilenberg–Steenrod <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>\n$$\r\nH\\colon \\mathsf{Top}\\to\\mathsf{Chain}(\\mathbb{Z})\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">这里</span> $\\mathsf{Chain}(\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模链复形构成的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$H$ <span lang=\"zh\">将同伦变为链同伦</span>; (<span lang=\"zh\">这是说</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">表现了</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴之间的函子</span> $\\mathsf{Ani}\\to\\mathsf{Chain}(\\mathbb{Z})$, <span lang=\"zh\">这里</span> $\\mathsf{Chain}(\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">是关于链同伦等价局部化得到的</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".)</li>\n<li>$H$ <span lang=\"zh\">将无交并变为直和</span>; (<span lang=\"zh\">这是说</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持余积</span>)</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">切除法则</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或称</span> Mayer–Vietoris <span lang=\"zh\">法则</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $Z\\to X$, $Z\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为闭</span> CW <span lang=\"zh\">子复形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $H(X\\cup_Z Y)\\simeq \\operatorname{Cone}(H(Z)\\to H(X)\\oplus H(Y))$. (<span lang=\"zh\">这基本上就是说</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴意义下的推出</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为映射锥表现的正是</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的推出</span>.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">同伦等价意义下</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">唯一的同调理论</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $H(*)\\simeq G$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}